<title>UK: ING Bank sets 400 mln DKK 10-year step-up bond.</title>
<headline>ING Bank sets 400 mln DKK 10-year step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following subordinated step-up bond was announced by lead manager Banque Bruxelles Lambert.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ING BANK</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN DKK   COUPON    *6.00	MATURITY    29.JAN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  102.00    PAY DATE    29.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    =	   YIELD	 6.78 PCT</p>
<p> NOTES     *FOR FIRST FIVE YEARS THEN 8.0 PCT TO YEAR EIGHT</p>
<p>		THEN 9.50 PCT THEREAFTER.</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LUX/AMST  PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) 10-50     SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    N0	  CRS DEFLT  N0	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENG/DUTCH MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC   1.375</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED UNDER AN EMTN PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
